              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "впрочем (vpróchem) — \"anyway, mind you\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Я не люблю мясо, впрочем, сегодня попробую. Ya ne lyublyú myáso, vpróchem, segódnya popróbuyu. I do not like meat; still, today I will try some."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It softens or partly takes back what was said: Впрочем, это неважно — anyway, it does not matter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "впрочем (vpróchem) is fused from в \"in\" and прочем, a form of прочий \"other, the rest\": as for the rest."
            }
          ]
        },
